@startuml UC6_SearchBikePath_Design
autonumber "<b>0:"
title [UC6] Search for a bike path

' =======================================================
' COMPONENT DEFINITION
' =======================================================
actor "User" as User
participant "Mobile Application" as Client

' External Service (Geocoding)
participant "MapServiceProvider" as Map

' Backend System
participant "PathSearchEngine" as Search
participant "BikePath DBMS" as DB

' =======================================================
' ENTRY CONDITION
' =======================================================
note over User, Client: Entry Condition: User presses "Search" to find a path

' =======================================================
' (a) GPS DETECTION & INIT
' =======================================================
User -> Client: clickSearch()
activate Client

' Acquisizione locale sensori
Client -> Client: acquireSensorData\n(GPS, gyro, accel)

' =======================================================
' (b) ORIGIN SELECTION
' =======================================================
Client --> User: CurrentCoordinates

alt Use Detected GPS Position
    User -> Client: selectPosition(CurrentCoordinates)
    note right of Client: Set Origin = Current Coords
else Use Manual Input
    User -> Client: selectPosition(name, city)
    
    ' Smart Client: Geocoding prima della ricerca
    note right of Client: Convert Position to Coords
    Client -> Map: getCoordinates(name, city)
    activate Map
    Map --> Client: OriginCoords (Lat, Lon)
    deactivate Map
end

' =======================================================
' (c) DESTINATION SELECTION
' =======================================================
Client --> User: ok
User -> Client: insertDestination(name, city)

' Smart Client: Geocoding Destination
Client -> Map: getCoordinates(name, city)
activate Map
Map --> Client: DestCoords (Lat, Lon)
deactivate Map

' =======================================================
' (d) PATH RETRIEVAL AND SCORING
' =======================================================
' Invio della query con le coordinate già pronte
note right of Client: Request paths matching Origin/Dest

Client -> Search: findBestPaths(originCoords, destCoords)
activate Search

' Query al DB: Trova percorsi vicini e ordinali per Score
note right of Search: Query logic: Proximity & High Score
Search -> DB: findPathsByProximityAndScore(originCoords, destCoords)
activate DB
DB --> Search: List<BikePath>
deactivate DB

' Conversione in DTO leggeri per la lista
Search --> Client: List<BikePath>
deactivate Search

Client -> User: displayPathSelection(List<BikePath>)

note over User, Client: Exit Condition: User presses "View" or "Exit"

deactivate Client
@enduml